# One line-ending convention for every tool: Codex edits from WSL write LF,
# so the working tree uses LF too (user, 2026-10-24). Windows scripts keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.exe binary
*.mp4 binary
